            "text": "To log in to **My Service Canada Account (MSCA)**, use the official Canada.ca page:\n\n**Go to:** ([canada.ca](https://www.canada.ca/myservicecanadaaccount?utm_source=openai))\n\nYou can sign in using one of these options:\n\n- **Interac\u00ae Sign-In Partner** \u2014 use your online banking login\n- **GCKey** \u2014 Government of Canada username and password\n- **Provincial sign-in** \u2014 available for **BC** and **Alberta** only\n\nIf you don\u2019t have an account yet, use the official registration page: ([canada.ca](https://www.canada.ca/en/employment-social-development/services/my-account/registration.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n**Tip:** Only sign in through pages on **Canada.ca** to avoid scams.",
